                                "sense_id": "fac633c2-5d27-3217-832b-03ef06311c75",
                                "text": "Zeg, wilt g' uw klein grut 'ne keer bijhouden? Da staat hier altijd maar te jengelen, te janken en te bleiten rond m'n benen, om zot van te worden!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "395c0dbd-83e3-4f4f-b993-ec63d24717a3",
                                "sense_id": "fac633c2-5d27-3217-832b-03ef06311c75",
                                "text": "\"Say, would you keep your little kid with you? It's always complaining, crying and screaming around my legs, it's to become crazy of!\""
